src/main.inset:10:35-10:44
the struct `Product` cannot derive `Serialize`
its field `kind` holds a `Kind`, which is not `Serialize`
help: remove `Serialize` from the `#[derive]`, or change the type of `kind`

src/main.inset:10:46-10:57
the struct `Product` cannot derive `Deserialize`
its field `kind` holds a `Kind`, which is not `Deserialize`
help: remove `Deserialize` from the `#[derive]`, or change the type of `kind`

src/main.inset:21:1-21:36
`#[serde]` needs a serde derive
`Kind` derives neither `Serialize` nor `Deserialize`
help: derive `Serialize` for a type replied as JSON, and `Deserialize` for one read from JSON
